.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH typst-info 1  "typst-info " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
typst\-info \- Displays debugging information about Typst
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBtypst\-info\fR [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-pretty\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Displays debugging information about Typst
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
The format to serialize in, if it should be machine\-readable.

If no format is passed the output is displayed human\-readable. Note that human\-readable format truncates the build commit hash value.
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
yaml
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
Whether to pretty\-print the serialized output.

Only applies to JSON format.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
